            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa mĩongo ĩtatũ na mũonza wa kũsumbĩka kwa Yoasi mũsumbĩ wa Yuta, Yeoasi mwana wa Yeoaasi ambĩlĩlya kũsumbĩka Isilaeli ku Samalia, na asumbĩka myaka ĩkũmi na thanthatũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na eekaa ũla Yeova wonaa wĩ ũthũku; ndaatia naĩ syonthe sya Yelovoamu mwana wa Nevati, ila wavĩtĩthisye Isilaeli nasyo; ĩndĩ aendaa nthĩnĩ wasyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ meko ala angĩ ma Yoasi, na w’onthe ũla wekaa, na vinya wake mũnene ũla wokitie Amasia mũsumbĩ wa Yuta naw’o, ti maandĩke ĩvukunĩ ya maũndũ ma mavinda ma asumbĩ ma Isilaeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.14.8+2KI.14.9+2KI.14.10+2KI.14.11+2KI.14.12+2KI.14.13+2KI.14.14+2KI.14.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Asu 14.8–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yoasi akoma na aaĩthe make: na Yelovoamu ekalĩla kĩvĩla kyake kya ũsumbĩ: na Yoasi athikwa Samalia vamwe na asumbĩ ma Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ Elisa aĩ mũwau ũwau wake ũla wamũaie: na Yoasi mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli atheea vala ũĩ, na amũĩĩa, na asya, Asa wakwa, asa wakwa, makasya ma Isilaeli na mbalasi syamo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Asu 2.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Elisa amwĩa, Osa ũta na mĩsyĩ; nake oosa ũta na mĩsyĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amwĩa mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli, Koota ũta na kw’oko kwaku; na ookoota na kw’oko kwake. Na Elisa ailĩĩla moko make ĩũlũ wa moko ma mũsumbĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na asya, Vingũa mbũthi ĩla yelekele wumĩlonĩ wa syũa; na amĩvingũa. Na ĩndĩ Elisa asya, Atha; na aatha. Na asya, Mũsyĩ wa Yeova wa kũkĩlya vinya, o mũsyĩ wa kũkĩlya Silia vinya; nũndũ ũkakũnĩa Asilia ku Aveki, kũvika wamamina vyũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na asya, Osa mĩsyĩ; na amyosa. Na amwĩa mũsumbĩ wa Isilaeli, Atha nthĩ; na aatha katatũ, na aeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũ mũndũ wa Ngai amũthatĩa, na amwĩa, Nĩwĩaĩlĩte kũatha mavinda atano kana thanthatũ: nĩvo ĩndĩ wĩĩthĩwa ũmĩkũna Silia kũvika wamĩmina vyũ; kwondũ wa ũu yu ũkakũna Silia o katatũ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
